<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-EVSTQN3/azprG1Anm3QDgpJLIm9Nao0Yz1ztcQTwFspd3yD65VohhpuuCOmLASjC" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{baseUrl}}style.css">
    <title>Course Persetujuan</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="main-wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <div class="header-logo">
                    <img src="{{baseUrl}}images/logo-setneg.png" alt="Logo Setneg">
                </div>
                <div class="header-address">
                    <p>
                        Jalan Gaharu I. No.1, Kel. Cipete Selatan,<br />
                        Kec. Cilandak, Jakarta Selatan, 12430
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <h4>
                    Mohon Maaf
                </h4>
                <p>
                    Pengajuan pendaftaran course <span><a href="{{courseUrl}}">{{courseTitle}}</a></span>, telah ditolak.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Alasan :<br/>
                    {{reason}}
                </p>
                <p>
                    Hubungi CS kami untuk informasi lebih lanjut. Terimakasih.
                </p>
                <div class="regards" style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
                    <h6>
                        Setneg Playbook<br/>The Ultimate Learning Hub
                    </h6>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="info-footer">
            <a href="#">
                FAQ
            </a>
            <div class="social-media">
                <a class="social-media-item" href="#">
                    <img src="{{baseUrl}}images/facebook.svg" alt="Social Media" />
                </a>
                <a class="social-media-item" href="#">
                    <img src="{{baseUrl}}images/twitter.svg" alt="Social Media" />
                </a>
                <a class="social-media-item" href="#">
                    <img src="{{baseUrl}}images/instagram.svg" alt="Social Media" />
                </a>
                <a class="social-media-item" href="#">
                    <img src="{{baseUrl}}images/whatsapp.svg" alt="Social Media" />
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="message-footer">
            Harap jangan membalas e-mail ini, karena e-mail ini dikirimkan secara otomatis oleh sistem.
        </p>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" integrity="sha384-MrcW6ZMFYlzcLA8Nl+NtUVF0sA7MsXsP1UyJoMp4YLEuNSfAP+JcXn/tWtIaxVXM" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
  </body>
</html>